 2026-07-03T20:58Z MS  note   start-of-night script ok, HCAM-2 at -25.1C after
↪7 min
 2026-07-03T21:17Z MS  open   dome open, Sable 64% 3.1m/s, Tern clear, Quill FW
↪HM 1.7"
 2026-07-03T21:40Z MS  note   twilight flats V R done, B skipped (too dark by t
↪he time V finished)
 2026-07-03T21:44Z MS  note   nightjar running standing VSS plan, 38 fast-caden
↪ce fields queued
