▌ O60: Training records (2026-09)

Decision: Every person who operates any telescope has a one-page training record
in ridge-ops/training/, listing what they are signed off for and when. Why: "I
think Min-jun did the catwalk training?" is a question that should have a
written answer.

Each record lists:

• Name and role.
• Sign-offs, each with the date and the signing staff member's initials: O4
  opening, O5 closing, O8 catwalk, O36 manual close, O42 red light, O43
  volunteer level.
• Anything the person is not yet signed off for, so that nobody assumes.
• A review date, one year after the most recent sign-off.

▌ O61: Things we decided not to do (2026-09)

Decision: Record the decisions not to do something, with the reason, so they are
not re-proposed every six months without new information. Why: Ideas come back.
That is fine. They should come back knowing why they left.

