exports[`snapshots of the layout IR as text meetings/2026-09-14-weekly.md @ 80 1`] = `
"▌ Weekly meeting — 2026-09-14

Present: Ada Okafor, Tomasz Wierzbicki, Priya Raman, Lena Hofstetter, Rosa
Delgado.

▌ Decisions

1. Dunmore's new primary mirror goes back to the coater; the reflectivity was 4%
   under spec.
   The coater pays for the return courier; we pay for the insurance.
2. Open nights move to Fridays from October (operations-handbook).
3. kenji-mori gets Aster on Tuesday and Thursday nights.
   Brill stays free for volunteers on those nights.
4. Lyra stays on Aster through the winter. Withdrawn: Tomasz needs it off for
   re-greasing in November.

▌ Actions

☐ Tomasz: book the courier for the mirror
☐ Priya: halley 2.4 release notes (pipeline-cookbook)
☑ Lena: update the visitor leaflet
☐ Rosa: check the Tern camera's dome heater before the first frost

▌ Notes

Weather station Sable logged 38 cloudy nights out of 61 this summer; see
observing-log-2026 for the nights we did get."
