"── ≡ properties ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 title       Dome refit
 tags        project, dome, maintenance
 status      planning
 budget_eur  18500
 owner       name: Rosa Lindqvist; role: facilities
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

▌ Dome refit

The dome shutter has jammed twice this winter. This note plans its refit over
the summer shutdown; the history is in observing-log-2026 and the safety rules
in operations-handbook. Supplier pages live at
www.shutter-supply.example.invalid and https://drives.example.invalid/catalogue.

▣ dome-shutter.png <attachments/dome-shutter.png>

The photo above is the shutter's drive plate, taken by Rosa before the last
repair.

▎ ℹ Note
▎ Front matter in this note is TOML (+++), as Hugo and Zola write it, not YAML.

▎ ❢ Important
▎ Nobody opens the dome alone while the refit is in progress.

▎ ✖ Weight
▎ The shutter segment weighs 140 kg. Use the gantry, never the ladder.
▎
▎ ▎ ✦ From the last refit
