▌ Steps

1. ☑ Order the replacement drive gear
2. ☐ Book the gantry for the second week of June
3. ☐ Recalibrate the shutter limit switches

▌ Parts

• drive gear, 42 teeth
• limit switches (two)
  ◦ spare microswitch
  ◦ wiring loom
• rail grease

The old gear goes to the instrument-inventory shelf, not the skip.

Filed under #dome/shutter and #budget/2026: the shutter is most of the refit,
and of this year's spend."
