 ] at line 2, column 1:
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

▌ Broken frontmatter

The frontmatter above is invalid YAML on purpose: an unclosed flow sequence in
the title and another in the tags. Whatever reads this note should show the body
anyway and not crash."
