│            │ Aster so that condensation     │ so an older controller         │
│            │ never forms on cold, still     │ silently keeps running the     │
│            │ nights near the ridge.         │ heater at full power.          │
├────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┤
│ auto-flat  │ Takes twilight flat fields     │ Disabling it means somebody    │
│            │ automatically when the sky     │ has to remember to take flats  │
│            │ brightness falls inside the    │ by hand before the first       │
│            │ configured window.             │ science frame.                 │
└────────────┴────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────┘

